558	 * Checkout in `mode: "setup"` records a card + off-session mandate WITHOUT charging
559	 * anything — the answer to "a $0 first month must still capture a card for renewal".
560	 * Returns to the hosting page; the wizard finalises via finalizeCardSetup (shared).
